                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "83c78125-7d81-3390-8478-c0fee8382ad7",
                        "entry_id": "1dfad7dd-cd37-3bd7-b8f5-1d8dd7ff8c5f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In an indissoluble manner; in a manner that is unable to be dissolved."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f1e5eea-ee3a-45f9-a4ad-5d63dd3bbc9a",
                                "sense_id": "83c78125-7d81-3390-8478-c0fee8382ad7",
                                "text": "Wedlok is the laufull couple of man & wife, ordeyned indissolubly to bring forth children, & to eschew fornicacion. […] I added this terme (indissolubly) that is to saye, vndepartably or wtout breakyng, that a man shold not thinke that wedlocke ones lawfullye made can be vndone & broken […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d21a0cb0-eea0-4e55-a5cb-5478e5dcf9bb",
                                "sense_id": "83c78125-7d81-3390-8478-c0fee8382ad7",
                                "text": "[…] On they move\nIndissolubly firm; nor obvious hill,\nNor straitening vale, nor wood, nor stream, divides\nTheir perfect ranks;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea5c3bf5-1713-4057-8970-fa04e8d1d9b3",
                                "sense_id": "83c78125-7d81-3390-8478-c0fee8382ad7",
                                "text": "[…] the day is already commenced which is to bind us indissolubly; and when we are once united, there shall be no recurrence of these mental terrors: I guarantee that."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "857d76f6-fd46-4ab5-b848-1bae96ba3444",
                                "sense_id": "83c78125-7d81-3390-8478-c0fee8382ad7",
                                "text": "I wouldn’t have mentioned the fellow to you at all, only it was from his lips that I first heard the name of the man who is so indissolubly connected with the memories of that time."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc5385af-a3d6-41d8-b994-4c24e2b962e2",
                                "sense_id": "83c78125-7d81-3390-8478-c0fee8382ad7",
                                "text": "The words that were said every day to others would be said to him, in that quiet consulting room whose desk and carpet and square modern armchair would share indissolubly in the moment."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3c7c854d-a164-41ca-9b6e-1ad8e26f5d4c",
                        "source_entry_id": "1dfad7dd-cd37-3bd7-b8f5-1d8dd7ff8c5f",
                        "source_sense_id": "83c78125-7d81-3390-8478-c0fee8382ad7",
